        "original_id": "4d01e992-12c4-5ab8-9805-e2ac71ee060b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ross Case, Slobodan Živojinović\n- Events: 1974 Pacific Coast Open\n- Roles: tennis players\n\nFacts:\n- Ross Case was born on 1 November 1951 and is an Australian former tennis player.\n- In 1974, unseeded Ross Case won the singles title at the 1974 Pacific Coast Open, earning $16,000 in first-prize money and 80 Grand Prix points.\n- In 1985, Slobodan Živojinović reached the semi-finals of the Australian Open in singles.\n- In 1986, Slobodan Živojinović reached the semi-finals of Wimbledon in singles.\n- Slobodan Živojinović achieved a career-high singles ranking of World No. 19.",
